docs {
  # Submit ASH Exit Form
  
  Records a student's exit from the ASH programme. Captures the reason for leaving, academic impact assessment, mentorship evaluation, post-ASH plans, and overall programme feedback.
  
  On success, the exit record is inserted into the database and cached. Returns a `201 Created` status.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `create` permission.
  
  ## Request Body (`application/json`)
  
  ### Student & Exit Details
  
  | Field              | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                                                      |
  |--------------------|--------|----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | studentId          | string | Yes      | Valid UUID referencing an existing ASH student record                                                                                              |
  | ageAtExit          | number | Yes      | Integer between `6` and `18`                                                                                                                      |
  | schoolName         | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                                                    |
  | classAtExit        | string | Yes      | One of: `PRIMARY 3`–`PRIMARY 6`, `JSS1`–`JSS3`, `SS1`–`SS3`                                                                                    |
  | durationInProgram  | string | Yes      | One of: `LESS THAN 6 MONTHS`, `6 MONTHS-1 YEAR`, `1 YEAR`–`12 YEARS`                                                                            |
  | exitReason         | string | Yes      | One of: `COMPLETED`, `GRADUATED`, `MOVED`, `PERSONAL / FAMILY`, `COULD NOT ATTEND`, `DROPPED OUT`, `OTHER`                                      |
  | exitDate           | date   | Yes      | ISO date string — format `YYYY-MM-DD`                                                                                                             |
  
  ### Academic Impact
  
  | Field                | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                          |
  |----------------------|--------|----------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | academicImpactRating | number | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `10`                                                                              |
  | areasOfImprovement   | array  | No       | Array of: `LITERACY`, `NUMERACY`, `VOCATIONAL`, `DIGITAL LITERACY`, `SOFT SKILLS`, `CHARACTER`, `OTHER` |
  
  ### Mentorship
  
  | Field                  | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                       |
  |------------------------|--------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | mentorshipReceived     | string | Yes      | One of: `REGULARLY`, `OFTEN`, `OCCASIONALLY`, `RARELY`, `NEVER`    |
  | mentorshipImpactRating | number | No       | Integer from `1` to `10` (optional)                                |
  
  ### Post-ASH Status
  
  | Field           | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                  |
  |-----------------|--------|----------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | postAshStatus   | string | Yes      | One of: `CONTINUING SCHOOL`, `COMPLETED SCHOOL`, `UNIVERSITY`, `VOCATIONAL`, `EMPLOYED`, `NOT IN TRAINING` |
  | institutionName | string | No       | Optional text                                                                                 |
  | courseOfStudy   | string | No       | Optional text                                                                                 |
  | vocationalSkill | string | No       | Optional text                                                                                 |
  
  ### Programme Feedback
  
  | Field                   | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values |
  |-------------------------|--------|----------|------------------------------|
  | enjoyedMost             | string | No       | Optional free text           |
  | programImpact           | string | No       | Optional free text           |
  | improvementSuggestions  | string | No       | Optional free text           |
  | facilitatorName         | string | Yes      | Non-empty text               |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`201 Created`** — Returns the newly created ASH exit record.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "...",
    "data": { ... },
    "meta": {
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  The created record is also cached under the key `cedarrise:ash:exit:<id>` using the `FORM_DATA` TTL.
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                                         |
  |-----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Validation failed — missing required fields or invalid enum values. |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                            |
}
